---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="Terms and conditions for the GovBB Design System.">
  <section class="govbb-width-container govbb-page-section">
    <div class="govbb-prose">
      <div class="govbb-page-header">
        <h1 class="govbb-page-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="govbb-page-subtitle">Using the GovBB Design System documentation and examples.</p>
      </div>
      <p>
        This site provides design guidance and implementation examples for Government of
        Barbados digital services. Teams remain responsible for testing their service, meeting
        applicable laws and policies, and making sure it works for the people who use it.
      </p>
      <h2>Using the guidance</h2>
      <p>
        Guidance may change as the design system develops. Check the <a href="/changelog/">changelog</a>
        and the status shown on reference pages before adopting or updating a component.
      </p>
      <h2>Code examples</h2>
      <p>
        Examples demonstrate the intended design and markup. Adapt them to your service and
        test the complete implementation, including accessibility, security, validation and
        content, before production use.
      </p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Links to other websites are provided for reference. The Government of Barbados is not
        responsible for the availability or content of external websites.
      </p>
      <p><small>Last updated 18 July 2026.</small></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
